We conducted a fixed-effect meta-analysis examining the standardized mean difference (SMD) between experimental and control conditions across studies. The analysis revealed a significant overall effect, SMD = `r round(m1$TE.fixed, 2)`, 95% CI [`r round(m1$lower.fixed, 2)`, `r round(m1$upper.fixed, 2)`], *p* = `r signif(m1$pval.fixed, 2)`.\
